WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.090 --> 00:00:01.760
- I love ending the show with a story

00:00:01.760 --> 00:00:04.150
that could possibly bring
you a little extra happiness.

00:00:04.150 --> 00:00:05.373
This is what I'm liking.

00:00:09.536 --> 00:00:11.460
When the world shut down in 2020

00:00:11.460 --> 00:00:13.810
a boy in the Northeast with nothing to do

00:00:13.810 --> 00:00:16.220
grabbed his surfboard
and headed to the beach.

00:00:16.220 --> 00:00:19.654
He made it his goal to surf
every day during lockdown.

00:00:19.654 --> 00:00:22.700
Two years later he's still
going and hasn't missed a day.

00:00:22.700 --> 00:00:26.510
Through sunshine, rain, sleet, and snow.

00:00:26.510 --> 00:00:29.740
11 year old, 11 year old Carter has a goal

00:00:29.740 --> 00:00:33.640
to surf 1000 days straight,
something that he is gonna hit

00:00:33.640 --> 00:00:34.920
at the beginning of next year.

00:00:34.920 --> 00:00:36.400
So let's get him in here right now.

00:00:36.400 --> 00:00:39.366
Say hi to Carter and his mama, Dawn.

00:00:39.366 --> 00:00:41.083
Hi.

00:00:41.083 --> 00:00:42.342
- Hi.
- Hi.

00:00:42.342 --> 00:00:44.650
- Oh my gosh, Carter. You're so cute.

00:00:44.650 --> 00:00:47.010
You look like a little surfer
kid, that little dimple.

00:00:47.010 --> 00:00:48.151
Oh my goodness.

00:00:48.151 --> 00:00:50.420
So this is a huge commitment Carter!

00:00:50.420 --> 00:00:51.500
So is it ever tough?

00:00:51.500 --> 00:00:54.470
Are you ever like, this
was a poor decision?

00:00:54.470 --> 00:00:56.180
- No, it's a lot of fun,

00:00:56.180 --> 00:00:58.560
but it can sometimes get a little rough

00:00:58.560 --> 00:01:01.400
when we get really high winds.

00:01:01.400 --> 00:01:04.480
- And we're always out there
to make sure that he's okay

00:01:04.480 --> 00:01:06.450
and that my husband watches him

00:01:06.450 --> 00:01:08.910
and we make sure that
he's as safe as possible

00:01:08.910 --> 00:01:11.478
and we can support his goals.

00:01:11.478 --> 00:01:12.610
- That's amazing.

00:01:12.610 --> 00:01:14.250
You must be an amazing surfer.

00:01:14.250 --> 00:01:16.630
You look like a ninja
riding a wave just there.

00:01:16.630 --> 00:01:19.550
Because you got to be all
covered up because it's snowing,

00:01:19.550 --> 00:01:21.440
Carter, that is crazy!

00:01:21.440 --> 00:01:23.320
So, and this isn't just about you, right?

00:01:23.320 --> 00:01:25.040
Like you're raising money, right?

00:01:25.040 --> 00:01:30.040
- Mmhm. Right now I just
started raising money

00:01:30.260 --> 00:01:33.412
for the people in Ukraine to help them.

00:01:33.412 --> 00:01:37.800
I've helped dogs get adopted

00:01:37.800 --> 00:01:40.070
and raised money for Surf Aid

00:01:40.070 --> 00:01:43.860
and helped my local food pantry.

00:01:43.860 --> 00:01:45.693
- Oh my gosh, Carter!

00:01:46.541 --> 00:01:48.790
What a great young man you're raising.

00:01:48.790 --> 00:01:50.570
Oh my gosh, that's a beautiful thing.

00:01:50.570 --> 00:01:53.240
Like to be thinking of
others at such a young age.

00:01:53.240 --> 00:01:54.420
Thank you so much, Carter.

00:01:54.420 --> 00:01:57.871
Thank you, Dawn, for
raising such a good kid.

00:01:57.871 --> 00:01:58.704
- Thank you.

00:01:58.704 --> 00:01:59.860
- I know you're going to make it.

00:01:59.860 --> 00:02:00.693
Come back,

00:02:00.693 --> 00:02:02.870
talk to us when you finally get
those thousand days, Carter.

00:02:02.870 --> 00:02:05.503
I'm liking your post right now, all right?

00:02:06.480 --> 00:02:07.500
And that's not all.

00:02:07.500 --> 00:02:09.500
Our season long partner, Pilot Pen,

00:02:09.500 --> 00:02:12.020
makers of G2, the go to pin
of "The Kelly Clarkson Show"

00:02:12.020 --> 00:02:15.083
want to honor ultimate
overachievers just like you, sir.

00:02:15.083 --> 00:02:17.690
So they're gonna be writing
you a check for $1000.

00:02:17.690 --> 00:02:18.540
How's that sound?

00:02:22.893 --> 00:02:23.800
- What do you say?

00:02:23.800 --> 00:02:25.420
- Thank you so much.

00:02:25.420 --> 00:02:27.133
- [Kelly] Oh my gosh, absolutely!

